codex
I found the precise sandbox incompatibility: processes see `/proc/self/exe`, but their numeric `/proc/<getpid()>/exe` entry is absent; Lean 4.22’s runtime uses the numeric form and aborts with “failed to locate application.” I’m applying a narrowly scoped local compatibility shim that redirects only `/proc/<digits>/exe` reads to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not modify the candidate, generated sources, Lean libraries, or proof checking. I’ll record and use it consistently for both preflight and the required clean build.
